---
const subtitle = "Sovereign Stack for Neurodivergent Families";
---

<section class="he-relative he-pt-32 he-pb-24 he-md-pt-40 he-md-pb-32 he-px-6 he-md-px-12 he-lg-px-16">
  <div class="he-max-w-7xl he-mx-auto">
    <div class="he-max-w-3xl he-space-y-6">
      <p class="he-font-mono he-text-xs he-tracking--0-2em- he-uppercase" style="color: var(--p31-accent);">Open Source · Sovereign · Neurodivergent-First</p>
      <h1 class="he-text-4xl he-md-text-6xl he-lg-text-7xl he-font-bold he-leading-tight" style="color: var(--p31-text);">
        {subtitle}
      </h1>
      <p class="he-text-lg he-md-text-xl he-max-w-2xl" style="color: var(--p31-text-secondary);">
        We built the stack. Now you can own it. Sovereign identity, care economy, and open research — all open source, all yours.
      </p>
      <div class="he-flex he-flex-col he-sm-flex-row he-items-start he-gap-4 he-pt-4">
        <a href="/signup" class="he-inline-flex he-items-center he-gap-2 he-px-6 he-py-3 he-rounded-lg he-font-semibold he-transition-all" style="background: var(--p31-accent); color: #000;">
          Deploy Your Own
          <span style="font-size: 14px;">→</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://github.com/p31labs/production" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="he-inline-flex he-items-center he-gap-2 he-px-6 he-py-3 he-rounded-lg he-font-semibold he-transition-all he-border" style="border-color: var(--p31-glass-border); color: var(--p31-text);">
          <span>GitHub</span>
          <span style="font-size: 12px; opacity: 0.7;">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
